.C1
subr
.C2
returns the reverse of the top level of the list L.
See (3b) for an equivalent definition.


.C0
(subst x y s)
.C1
subr
.C2
substitutes the s-expression x for all top-level occurences
or the s-expression y in s, according to the following definition:
.br
(de subst (x y s) (cond
((equal y s) x)
((atom s) s)
(t (cons
(subst x y (car s))
(subst x y (cdr s))
))))


.C0
